---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const contactEmail = "code.sudeepto@gmail.com";
---

<PageLayout
	title="Contact Us — Lorem Ipsum Generator"
	description="Get in touch with the Lorem Ipsum Generator team. Send feedback, report an issue, or suggest a new themed word bank."
	eyebrow="Get in touch"
	heading="Contact Us"
>
	<p>
		Have feedback, found a bug, or want to suggest a new themed word bank?
		We'd like to hear from you.
	</p>

	<h2>Email</h2>
	<p>
		The fastest way to reach us is by email at{" "}
		<a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. We aim to respond
		to most messages within a few business days.
	</p>

	<h2>What to include</h2>
	<p>
		To help us respond quickly, tell us which page you were on, your browser
		and device (for example, Safari on iPhone), the generator settings you
		used (unit, amount, and theme), and what you expected to happen. For
		suggestions such as a new word bank or export format, a short
		description of the use case is plenty.
	</p>

	<h2>Topics we can help with</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Bug reports and unexpected generator output</li>
		<li>Suggestions for new themes, units, or export formats</li>
		<li>Privacy, data, or advertising questions (see our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>)</li>
		<li>Reporting an ad that looks inappropriate or broken, including the page and a screenshot if possible</li>
		<li>Press, partnership, or licensing enquiries</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Who runs this site</h2>
	<p>
		Lorem Ipsum Generator is an independent project maintained by a small
		team and published at loremmaker.com. Messages go directly to the people
		who build and maintain the tool, not to an automated inbox.
	</p>

	<h2>Before you write in</h2>
	<p>
		If your question is about how the generator works — paragraph vs.
		character-count mode, exporting as HTML or Markdown, or the themed word
		banks — check our{" "}
		<a href="/#faq">FAQ section</a> first. It covers most common questions.
	</p>

	<div class="mt-4 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 sm:flex-row">
		<a
			href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}
			class="rounded-pill bg-ink px-[14px] py-2.5 text-button-lg font-medium text-on-primary transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
		>
			Email us
		</a>
		<a
			href="/"
			class="rounded-pill border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated px-[14px] py-2.5 text-button-lg font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-hairline-soft"
		>
			Back to generator
		</a>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
